			<Label>@TFM:TFMPageListDataBindingHelp</Label>
			<Tags>&lt;h2&gt;Data Binding&lt;/h2&gt;This page sets up the binding between the datasource, and what is displayed on the output on the device.&lt;br&gt;&lt;h4&gt;&lt;b&gt;Adding data to the design&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;Data is normally populated from the standard Mobile WMS source, but in the grid, changes can be made. If you want to add or replace data displayed you can make a new record in the grid, indicating which cell in the design you want to modify.&lt;h4&gt;&lt;b&gt;Example Data&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/h4&gt; in the bottom fast tab, you have an overview of data on the given data source that is active. If you want to change which record is being used for the example, the button in the top "Select Data for Data Source" can be used for this.&lt;h4&gt;&lt;b&gt;Additional Help&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;For further help please look at our documentation &lt;a href="https://docs.taskletfactory.com/pages/viewpage.action?pageId=47221396"&gt;online&lt;/a&gt;.</Tags>
		</AxEnumValue>
